					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-625246#post-4676983</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-625246/doctors-of-the-church-hub#post-4676983</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 05 Jun 2020 05:55:02 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Ihp</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1267048</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>In retrospect, this has got to be the worst canon hub on the site in terms of telling you how to contribute. No guide for tone, no outline of major characters, the history of the setting, potential ideas for plot hooks, nothing. The content of the canon can be good, but the barrier for actually writing for it is damn near insurmountable, considering all of the original writers seem to have left the site.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
